<section>
	<h1>About the App</h1>
	<p>
		<strong>truckload.io</strong> is a 3D truckload packing visualization and load optimization tool, now
		available as a native iOS app.
	</p>
	<p>
		Plan freight loads visually before they ever reach the dock. Arrange cargo, minimize dead space, and
		finalize your packing plan - all from your iPhone.
	</p>
</section>

<section>
	<h2>Features</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Interactive 3D visualization of trailer space</li>
		<li>Load optimization to minimize wasted space</li>
		<li>Add and arrange cargo items with dimensions and weight</li>
	</ul>
</section>

<section>
	<h2>System Requirements</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>iOS 16.0 or later</li>
	</ul>
</section>

<section>
	<h2>Privacy</h2>
	<p>
		truckload.io uses a Google Cloud backend service to handle the 3D load placement calculation operations. This is a processing backend that does not store any information about configurations or cargo items. <a href="privacy">View our full privacy policy.</a>
	</p>
</section>

